#   canonical /blog/restore-vhs-wedding-footage/. 0 deploy cost
#   (static _redirects file), preserves any SEO value accumulated on
#   the old paths during pre-rename indexing.
# Safe to delete: after 2027-01-23 (6-month retention). At that point
#   all 4xx crawl + 6-month user-share decay should have flushed
#   external references. Until then, prefer to keep.
# To regenerate this block after adding a new blog post: re-run
#   scripts/rename-blog-dirs.py against a fresh rename map.

# === 2026-08-08 reorganized: all blog migration rules at top ===
